T1  - From Judicial Management to Business Rescue: A Critical Analysis of the Meaning and Purpose of Business Rescue in South Africa Since 1926
AU  - Phungula Simphiwe P
Y1  - 2024/10/01
PY  - 2024
DA  - 2024/10/01
N1  - doi: 10.47348/FUND/v30/i1a2
